  { q: 'Does the ADA apply to websites and apps?', a: 'For businesses open to the public, the US Department of Justice says yes: its March 2022 guidance states the ADA applies to their web offerings. Courts still split on websites with no physical location. Best Answer Hub recommends planning as if the answer is yes, because lawsuits are filed either way and defending one costs money.' },
