      <h1>ADA Website Lawsuits: <em>What Vibe-Coded Apps Get Wrong</em></h1>
      <p class="dek">A viral video warns that an AI-built app can earn a demand letter for a picture with no label. The real lawsuit numbers back the warning, the "$4,000 letter from New York" detail does not, and the fix is cheaper than the letter. Here is what the 2025 data shows, the six errors AI tools keep shipping, and a test any founder can run without reading code.</p>
